WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.628 --> 00:00:04.671 line:0%
No one dishes it out like family.

00:00:04.755 --> 00:00:06.507 line:0%
Get ready to be old-schooled.

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:08.175 line:0%
Nothing like family
to keep you woke.

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:10.260 line:0%
And telling it like it is.

00:00:12.346 --> 00:00:13.222 line:0%
Ready.

00:00:13.305 --> 00:00:14.765 line:0%
-Call 'em out.
-Let me hear it, let me hear it.

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:15.891 line:0%
Rapid fire.

00:00:16.892 --> 00:00:17.851 line:0%
I remember being punished.

00:00:17.935 --> 00:00:20.354 line:0%
We knew we had it coming,
and it was coming hard.

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:22.606 line:0%
I love being punished.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.149 line:0%
I just get to go on Snapchat.

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:26.985 line:0%
Oh, you going to learn today.
Mm-hmm.

00:00:28.237 --> 00:00:31.740 line:0%
Being a mom means enforcing
the rules with a firm "no."

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:34.576 line:0%
Rules?
I think you mean "suggestions."

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:36.537 line:0%
-No.
-What happens if mom says no?

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:37.454 line:0%
Ask dad.

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:41.625 line:0%
We love having our family
living with us

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:44.419 line:0%
so we can help raise the kids.

00:00:44.503 --> 00:00:46.964 line:0%
It's like I always said,
it takes a village.

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.633 line:0%
It takes way too long to get
any hot water in this house.

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:54.304 line:0%
Oh, I don't even want to know.

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.599 line:0%
I'm proud of how
we raise our kids in Seattle.

00:00:57.683 --> 00:00:59.601 line:0%
They're mature,
well-behaved children of God.

00:00:59.685 --> 00:01:01.687 line:0%
-Get me a root beer.
-What's the magic word?

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:02.855 line:0%
Now.

00:01:02.938 --> 00:01:03.897 line:0%
Oh...

00:01:03.981 --> 00:01:05.732 line:0%
Yes, 9-1-1, we got a homicide.

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:09.194 line:0%
Family always keeps it real.

00:01:09.278 --> 00:01:12.072 line:0%
Nobody brings you down like
the people who brought you up.

00:01:12.155 --> 00:01:13.907 line:0%
What happened to
<i>"Mi casa es su casa"?</i>

00:01:13.991 --> 00:01:17.703 line:0%
<i>Mi casa,</i> my<i> casa.</i>
If you don't like that, pay<i> renta.</i>

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:22.749 line:0%
Just because you're related
doesn't mean you relate.

00:01:25.836 --> 00:01:27.004 line:0%
-Let me try.
-Oh!

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.173 line:0%
-Oh...
-Oops.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:34.386 line:0%
We're one big happy family
under one happy roof.

00:01:35.179 --> 00:01:36.014 line:0%
Oh!

